{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">無綫旅遊節目《江湖見》第二季20日一集，黎耀祥（祥哥）與麥長青（麥包）暢遊大同的恆山懸空寺、大同古城及雲岡石窟，品嚐「百花燒賣」、「鳳趴窩」、「北魏酪漿」及「北魏羊羹」等地道美食。在恆山懸空寺一站，兩人更邀得「永遠的令狐冲」呂頌賢擔任嘉賓，以茶代酒笑傲江湖，暢談昔日拍金庸劇的難忘點滴。</p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">節目中，麥包提到令狐冲身為華山派大師兄兼恆山派掌門，祥哥笑指早前暢遊華山時應找呂頌賢同行。呂頌賢即「令狐冲上身」笑言：「好彩冇叫咋！我係華山棄徒，畀人趕咗出嚟，恆山就唔同，我係掌門人，成個大同我話事。」展現角色調皮本色。</p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">隨後三人前往大同古城的茶舍話當年。呂頌賢自爆現實中茹素多年且甚少飲酒，當年要飾演愛酒如命的令狐冲可謂「後患無窮」：「害得我好慘！內地好多酒民見到我都話：『你仲唔飲酒』！」更笑說常被人拎住壺來「拎壼沖」。談到令狐冲成為經典，他謙稱全因劇本與人設出色，直言身為金庸迷，接到角色時興奮不已。</p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"4e51b4be-e43d-4e10-a6a2-e55402f073ec.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026uyP3WT44KK1784629994.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"4e51b4be-e43d-4e10-a6a2-e55402f073ec.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"b0e2079a-ae89-442e-ac10-517eb37fcd21.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026iO5KdSRBTk1784629998.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"b0e2079a-ae89-442e-ac10-517eb37fcd21.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">談到拍攝金庸劇的最難忘經歷，呂頌賢透露拍打戲因身材夠Fit而「從無受傷」，最難反而是借酒澆愁的文戲。他憶述當年與飾演師弟的演員排戲時並無異狀，正式拍攝時對方卻突然「兜口兜面打落嚟」；最哭笑不得的是對方事後竟稱「突然覺得應該要咁做」，讓他直呼「真係想打佢」。</p><h3 style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">呂頌賢又坦言對令狐冲這個角色又愛又恨：「愛嘅係帶來好多成功因素畀我，好多人搵我拍戲啦，好多外快啦；恨嘅係呢個角色霸佔咗我成個演藝生涯，大家接受咗角色成為經典之後，無論我做乜嘢，都唔係呂頌賢去做，係令狐冲去做。」他試過演反派，結果被不少網民怪責：「你點解畀令狐冲去做反派？」難怪三人會齊齊感嘆「成也令狐，敗也令狐！」</span></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-23T01:19:31.366395+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":684,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}